AUDIO: 'generated and then we\'ll look at some other features of this. Now, this is the first one that I drafted myself from scratch without the template. This is a spoof of a McDonald\'s commercial with sound. Have a listen. &gt;&gt; The new Lawn Burger is here for a'

[03:31] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'limited time. &gt;&gt; Only at Lawn Donald\'s. &gt;&gt; So, you now can have an AI slop machine in your house, but the good news is is that you\'re not burning tokens doing it.'

[03:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
